abstract: >-
  Desktop annotation, segmentation, time-series tracking, and phenotyping
  software for Hades and Lucifer plant imaging datasets, including a validated
  five-seedling Arabidopsis ownership workflow for Yang Song of the
  DroughtFighters project, Plant Microbe Interaction group, Utrecht University.
